@@ -2,6 +2,16 @@

 JSON in, JSON out. Routes are listed in `README.md`.

+## Sites
+
+Send `X-Larder-Site` with a site ID. Requests without the header use `main`.
+An unknown ID returns HTTP 400 with code `unknown_site`.
+
+Batch list, detail and waste, item stock on hand, cooking, stock value,
+alerts, stock CSV exports and stock-takes use the selected site's locations.
+Order receipts must use locations at the selected site. Items, suppliers,
+recipes and dishes are shared.
+
 ## Errors

 Errors have a status from `src/errors.js` and the body
